<title>UK: TABLE-Thames Water year profit surges.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Thames Water year profit surges.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		82.8		   vs 50.7</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 23.2		   vs 19.1</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) 34.4		   vs 28.3</p>
<p> Pretax		     371.8		  vs 228.7</p>
<p> Turnover		   1,287.4		vs 1,193.6</p>
<p>NOTE - Current year results include an exceptional charge of 12.2 million stg for a non-recurring premium on the buyback of convertible bonds. Excluding the exceptional item, pretax profit was 384 million stg.</p>
<p>Analysts had forecast pre-tax profits in a range between 350 and 384 million stg.</p>
<p>Full company name - Thames Water Plc. --London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
